# The repository root is the build context for ml/Dockerfile. Without this it
# ships 67 GB of corpora, checkpoints and database dumps to the daemon on every
# build; the image needs `etl`, `ml` and one model directory.
*
!etl/
!ml/
!models/v3-xenc/

etl/.venv/
ml/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
